    lg:`$S_{\\text{đáy}} = \\dfrac{${a}^2\\sqrt{3}}{4} = ${rT(a*a,3,4)}$; $V = S_{\\text{đáy}}\\cdot h = ${rT(a*a,3,4)}\\cdot ${h} = ${rT(a*a*h,3,4)}$.`,
