      + `$F\\left(${E(m)}\\right) = ${a}\\cdot ${m} ${p < 0 ? '-' : '+'} ${Math.abs(p)} = ${a*m + p}$, $F\\left(-${E(n)}\\right) = ${a}\\cdot ${n} ${q < 0 ? '-' : '+'} ${Math.abs(q)} = ${a*n + q}$.<br>`
