    ans,
    lg:`Bình phương vô hướng: $F^2 = F_1^2 + F_2^2 + 2F_1 \\cdot F_2 \\cdot \\cos\\alpha$.<br>$\\cos\\alpha = \\dfrac{${h*h} - ${a*a} - ${b*b}}{2 \\cdot ${a} \\cdot ${b}} = ${frT(h*h - a*a - b*b, 2*a*b)}$, suy ra $\\alpha \\approx ${ans}^\\circ$.`,
