    lg:`$F(x) = ${mhS(k)}e^{x} + C$; $F(0) = ${k} + C = ${c}$ nên $C = ${c - k}$.<br>$F(\\ln 3) = ${ngPa(3*k)}${c - k ? ngSg(c - k) : ''} = ${v}$.`,
